# Scan summaries under results/ are deliberately tracked.  They are aggregated
# observables rather than configurations -- tens of kilobytes each -- so keeping
# them in the repository makes the analysis reproducible from a clone alone.
# If a future run starts writing per-realization data, revisit this.
